uc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"GZDkhotwnmGlpYUKxAwobw","review_id":"iVdtAA17b0aZPBH42YFRhw","date":"2020-10-05T21:02:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9050703048706055,"text_excerpt":"Such an easy and quick place to get a good plate. They give you lots of food with your order. Food is always fresh and hot, I've never been disappointed."},{"business_id":"GZDkhotwnmGlpYUKxAwobw","review_id":"2J85WrRyhommOEEjAonKnA","date":"2020-02-16T23:59:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9020883440971375,"text_excerpt":"This was a secret to us although we live in the East. A couple of months ago my mother in law was injured and couldn't drive so she had to reveal to us this place us as we were picking her up food to eat. We have eaten here several times and it is pretty much our go to place in the East when we have been eating bland food for days upon days and are willing to burn off the extra calories in this meal at the gym. We have made a conscious decision to only eat there once a month because they do not shortchange you any salt or butter if it would add flavor to the meal. This is a buffet style restaurant where pick a protein and then pick your sides. I know everyone has said this already but thi..."},{"business_id":"GZDkhotwnmGlpYUKxAwobw","review_id":"WhqHfFWsGKmTBXHPrIe5-Q","date":"2017-06-23T15:46:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8987807631492615,"text_excerpt":"I'm in town for a few days and my Mom had me to go there to pick up dinner for her and my Dad. From the look of the place you can tell it was a Local spot which is usually a good thing no matter what city your in especially if there is a line of local people waiting to order. I got the Baked Fish with mashed potatoes for the parents and figured I would try the Shrimp Pasta. I was partially greeted by the you lady with a, \"Did your order yet\"? Lol. (On a side note I have to say that service all over New Orleans is just not what it used to be I'm afraid, there was a time when service and a good time were synonymous with the city in mind. Another girl came over when she saw the stunned look ..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
